        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Restaurant Door Fork and Spoon Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese pulls were designed to bring a bit of whimsey to any restaurant front door. While the Fork and Spoon Restaurant Door Pull Set are great for commercial applications, they would look just as fun in the home. They would be great mounted on the door to a pantry or even and a side-board handles. The set includes both the fork and the spoon and they can be thru-bolt mounted, surface-mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/fork-and-spoon-refrigerator-door-pulls-first-impressions-ap-forkspoon\"> Fork and Spoon as a refrigerator pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Fork and Spoon Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Width of Fork Pull: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Width of Spoon Pull: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 7-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Set - 1 Fork Pull and 1 Spoon Pull</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fork and Spoon Door Pull Set",
                "description": "These pulls were designed to bring a bit of whimsey to any restaurant front door. While the Fork and Spoon Restaurant Door Pull Set are great for commercial applications, they would look just as fun in the home. They would be great mounted on the door to a pantry or even and a side-board handles. The set includes both the fork and the spoon and they can be thru-bolt mounted, surface-mounted, or back-to-back mounted.",
